{"id":"vod_bf_14281","vodId":"14281","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"滑头鬼之孙","name_cn":"滑头鬼之孙","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-15/02676b9e3ca3ba5b1d7bdb7033075609.jpg"},"summary":"滑头鬼，是统领着百鬼夜行的妖怪总大将。十三岁的奴良陆生（福山润 配音）看似是一名普通中学生，喜欢着同班同学家长加奈（平野绫 配音）。但其实他有四分之一的妖怪血统，是大妖怪“滑头鬼”的孙子。他被 “奴良组”众妖怪尊称为少主，身边有个叫及川冰丽（崛江由衣 配音）的亲信。但他一心只想当一个普通人类，不肯承认自己是妖怪的事实，更不愿继承奴良组三代目之位。　　四年前一次意外，使他觉醒了妖怪之血，暂时恢复了妖怪的相貌，但是到了白天，他又变回了人类的模样并且还会忘记自己是妖怪这件事。自此以来，奴良陆生仍过着平静的人类生活。但其实自觉醒之日起，他便已经立下志愿要继承奴良组三代目，站在众鬼之巅，成为魑魅魍魉之主。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-09 21:35:01","playable":true,"episodeCount":27,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"SP","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huatouguizhisun/SP/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huatouguizhisun/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huatouguizhisun/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huatouguizhisun/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huatouguizhisun/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huatouguizhisun/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huatouguizhisun/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huatouguizhisun/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huatouguizhisun/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huatouguizhisun/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huatouguizhisun/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huatouguizhisun/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huatouguizhisun/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huatou